OL,3,GNEWSAWill there be enough pumpkins for
OL,4,AHalloween?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery October, thousands flock to
OL,7,Fpumpkin patches across the country to
OL,8,Ftake autumnal photos and pick a pumpkin
OL,9,Fto take home.
OL,11,FPumpkin patches have been lucrative for
OL,12,Ffarms over the years, with many people
OL,13,Favoiding supermarkets, instead wanting
OL,14,Fan authentic autumn experience on their
OL,15,Fdoorstep.
OL,17,FBut at many farms, the fields of
OL,18,Fpumpkins are already ripe, with almost
OL,19,Ftwo months to go until Halloween.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
