OL,3,GNEWSAWill there be enough pumpkins for
OL,4,AHalloween?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Jones from Llynclys Hall Farm,
OL,7,Fnear Oswestry in Shropshire, was born
OL,8,Fon the farm, and has worked it all his
OL,9,Flife.
